	(text "Carrier sheet 1: the charger, battery, power switch and power path, the 5 V boost and 3.3 V buck, the\nmodule's sockets, the reset and G0 buttons, the microSD socket, the Grove port, the FPC expansion connector\nand the IR emitter.\n\nMain parts: U1 TP4057, J1 J8 battery, Q1-Q3 LP3218DT1G, SW1, U3 CN809J, U2 SY7088, U4 SY8089, P1 P2 module\nsockets, BTN1 BTN2, J3 microSD, J2 Grove, SW2, FPC1, IR1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 48.26 0)
		(effects
