	(text "The module's sheet (Stamp-S3 v0.3.3): the ESP32-S3FN8 with its RF path, crystal and decoupling, the 3.3 V\nbuck, the LCD connectors and backlight switch, the RGB LED, the G0 button, the USB-C and the module's pins.\n\nMain parts: U101 ESP32-S3FN8, ANT101, X101, U104 JW5712, U102 AW35122FDR, J101 J103 LCD FPC, U103 WS2812,\nS101, J102 USB-C, F101, M101 module pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
